!< Instance of [[nasto_eos_object]]. instance % mu = mu instance % kd = kd instance % dha = dha if ( present ( cp ). and . present ( cv )) then instance % cp = cp instance % cv = cv elseif ( present ( gam ). and . present ( R )) then instance % cv = R / ( gam - 1._R8P ) instance % cp = gam * instance % cv elseif ( present ( gam ). and . present ( cp )) then instance % cp = cp instance % cv = cp / gam elseif ( present ( gam ). and . present ( cv )) then instance % cp = gam * cv instance % cv = cv elseif ( present ( R ). and . present ( cp )) then instance % cp = cp instance % cv = cp - R elseif ( present ( R ). and . present ( cv )) then instance % cp = cv + R instance % cv = cv endif call instance % compute_derivate endfunction nasto_eos_instance","tags":"","url":"proc/nasto_eos_instance.html"},{"title":"compute_derivate – ADAM","text":"private elemental subroutine compute_derivate(self) Compute derivate quantities (from cp and cv ). Type Bound nasto_eos_object Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( nasto_eos_object ), intent(inout) :: self Fluid physics. Called by proc~~compute_derivate~~CalledByGraph proc~compute_derivate nasto_eos_object%compute_derivate proc~load_from_file nasto_eos_object%load_from_file proc~load_from_file->proc~compute_derivate proc~nasto_eos_instance nasto_eos_instance proc~nasto_eos_instance->proc~compute_derivate interface~nasto_eos_object nasto_eos_object interface~nasto_eos_object->proc~nasto_eos_instance proc~load_from_file~3 nasto_physics_object%load_from_file proc~load_from_file~3->proc~load_from_file proc~initialize~7 nasto_physics_object%initialize proc~initialize~7->proc~load_from_file~3 Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls